WEBVTT

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.590
Wiping off my tears.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.300
I'm starting to run now

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:18.560
Tomorrow I'll be born anew.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.370
How could "you always be my friend"?

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.280
That person's word makes me more courageous.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.480
There are times when it's possible I will be depressed

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.580
and there are times when things are delightful.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:45.170
I'll always be

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:51.020
next to you.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.910
Smiling 100%

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.450
Striking 100%

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.640
I've come so far.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.560
Being 100% pure

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.190
The things I want to tell you

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.670
change to treasure completely.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.190
in the 100% case

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.950
Even if it's a long distance,

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:27.280
I'll still say I would meet you with the same feelings.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.140
It's over!

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.640
Pink water drops!

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.180
That's the first time I've seen them in a while!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.570
Forgive me, Megu!

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:14.650
I just saw them a little!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.780
Just a bit when we were dropping.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.280
So take this, and forgive me!

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:24.870
You're wrong if you think one ice
cream will make me feel better!

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.590
Hey you two!

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.290
Sorry to interrupt!

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:34.300
Land's beloved character, Courage-chan!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:38.840
It's me.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.090
Kinta!

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:41.550
Another job?

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:42.550
Yeah.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:48.890
Anyways, here's a Courage-chan doll for the happy lovers.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.200
We're not!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.370
I just happened to get two tickets from somebody,

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.450
and Kyuu didn't seem to have anything to do today!

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:55.610
Yup!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.570
So you see, we're just coming here together!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.740
Her fervent denials prove it.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.450
I said!

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.540
What was that?

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.880
Are you OK?

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:15.840
What happened?

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.300
That's... a bomb?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.570
The Terrifying Jewel Bomb!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.280
I'm sure you all know why I've called you here.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.790
The explosion that the Q-class encountered

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:53.540
is the third of a series of bombings that has
been continuing over the last few days.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:55.580
Katagiri-kun.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.300
The first bomb was two days ago at 10 AM.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.930
The place was the Friendship Memorial Hospital.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.060
The second was at 3 PM yesterday,

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.600
at Fidelity Bank's main office.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.600
And today at 1 PM, at Courage land.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.980
Damn! Who could be doing this!?

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.280
Calm down, Touyama.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:26.700
And just a while ago we got a request from
the police officially asking for our help.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:29.330
Then we're going to solve the case?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.250
Yes, terrorist bombings are a terrible, unforgivable crime.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:37.880
In order to keep any further damage from occurring

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:41.550
I'm going to ask you all to do
your best to solve the crime!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.260
Yes!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.010
I'll explain the rest.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.720
The marked places are the locations of the bombings.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.640
They're all within three kilometers
of each other: quite close.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.690
A hospital, a bank and an amusement park.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.770
They're all places with a lot of people in them.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.400
Then if the criminal was going to attack again...

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.280
This area is one of the busiest in the city.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.410
There are tons of places he could choose.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.580
Do you have a profile of the bomber?

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:10.870
Look at this.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:12.910
That's...

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:17.420
These photos were all taken directly after the bombings.

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.210
And if you look closely at them...

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:27.640
That's the same person!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:28.550
It's true.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:34.140
Criminals like this return to the scene after the
crime to see the destruction they've caused.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:36.980
That means he's the criminal?

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.600
It's quite likely.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.770
Wait, I saw him at the amusement park!

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:43.480
Are you serious?

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.990
A man with a ruby in his teeth.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.610
A ruby?

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:49.500
Yeah

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.210
A bright red ruby.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:56.160
But look, in the first and second photos there's no ruby.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:06:00.380
Which means that sometime between 3 PM yesterday,

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.840
and 1 PM today he had a ruby embedded in his teeth.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:08.010
There aren't many hospitals that will do that.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.640
And given what we know from his
crimes, it's probably a nearby one.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.720
Let's check it out immediately.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.570
May my deeds bring pleasure to the gods

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.870
and may the sparkle of jewelry reside within me.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.840
We found it pretty easily.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:50.050
Jewelry summoner, Octure Andre, real name Taiki Yoshinari.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.010
Ryuu,

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.260
what's a Jewelry Summoner?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:58.480
I've heard they're people who use the spiritual
power of jewels to speak with the dead.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.490
Touyama and I will go inside.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:11.990
You two wait here.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:13.240
Understood.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.990
Touyama, be careful.

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:16.740
Gotcha!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:23.790
Excuse me.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.380
We're with DDS.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.010
Yoshinari Taiki.

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:51.490
Ryuu!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:56.030
Alright Ryuu!

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:57.990
We've got him.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:01.040
 Using a bomb that close, this dude is nuts!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:05.960
The fourth god shall descend from heaven soon.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:07.920
What do you mean?

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.050
Sensei, take him!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.310
The fourth box is empty.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:23.230
That means that he's planted a fourth bomb.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.900
The 5th through 12th boxes all have bombs in them.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.060
Seems like you're right then.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.150
Where?!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.690
Where did you put the bomb?

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:42.360
When the two needles point toward
the heavens, you will know.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.630
Don't screw with me!

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.340
The two needles point toward the heavens...

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:49.970
12 o'clock!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.520
Do you mean the bomb will go off at 12?

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:57.560
This city is a holy ground where the gods of jewelry dwell.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.650
The sparkle of a jewel is the melody of the gods.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:07.110
And the fourth god is the ultimate power.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:12.410
It shall surely visit upon you a tragedy far
have ever experienced.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:15.040
Why you! Would you shut up already!?

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.630
Just tell us where the bomb is!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.670
Why you!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.380
Stop it, Touyama!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:25.380
Touyama!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.260
"Stop it"?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.970
So we just wait for the bomb to go off then?

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.720
Nobody's saying that!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.220
Then?!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.140
Touyama-kun, stop it!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.190
Dan-sensei.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.770
He won't talk easily, I suspect.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.520
We don't have time.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.400
We shall question the suspect.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.990
You check if there's anything in this room that
could indicate where the bomb was placed.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.330
Yoshinari Taiki,

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:54.830
DDS has placed you under arrest.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:56.000
Come.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:01.380
This is Kyuu.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.000
We checked the whole place,

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.800
but there's nothing to indicate
where the bomb was placed.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:09.220
I see.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:10.760
We'll continue our efforts.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.020
It seems you have us at a disadvantage.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.640
Tell us your demands.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.860
What can we do to make you tell us where the bomb is?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.490
Ishikinoberina, Ishikinoberina.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.570
Very well.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.490
Let me sit in that wheelchair.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:38.120
You're the leader of DDS.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.130
In other words, that wheelchair is equal to a throne.

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:47.920
And that throne is fit for only I, who
can hear the voices of the gods.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:49.930
That is your condition?

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.560
Honqou-kun lend me your shoulder.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.230
Who said you could ask for help?

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.730
This is a trade between you and me.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.940
You can't ask for help.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:10.610
Understood.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:21.370
Dan-sensei!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:23.630
Is that what you wanted?

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.680
Tell us. Where is the bomb?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.520
What do you think is the greatest pleasure
the gods have given to men?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.230
What is it?

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.440
To lie and break a promise.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.950
Dammit. Where did he put the bomb?

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.750
"This city is a holy ground where
the gods of jewelry dwell.”

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:10.460
Yes. Why did the criminal choose this area?

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.470
I think there's some secret hidden in those words.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:18.510
And the number of bombs that were prepared: 12.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:24.060
It's true that the boxes with the bombs in them
all have names of jewels written on them.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.230
Ame...

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:27.820
What was it?

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:28.860
Amethyst!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:32.530
Now I can read

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:36.740
Wait. Aren't these all birthstones?

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:37.990
Birthstones?

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.000
Garnet is the January Birthstone.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.170
Amethyst is for February.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.210
Wait...

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.300
You're right.

00:12:58.490 --> 00:12:59.010
I get it!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.350
The fog has cleared.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:02.430
What?

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:05.980
Yeah.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:07.280
There are two hints.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:12.990
The first is that the fourth bomb was
placed in the box marked "Diamond".

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.490
And the second is the meaning that
the jewels are said to carry.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:20.160
And there's one answer!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:35.160
The fourth god walks towards us even now.

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.450
The vibration of a crystal is accurate.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.830
That is why they can be used as the core of a watch.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:46.750
The crystal is also enshrined in an important position
within integrated circuit cards and computers as well.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:51.970
In other words, this world is ruled by my gods!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:57.300
Just as you are ruled by the fourth
god that will descend soon.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:05.900
We've found where the fourth bomb was placed!

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:09.110
Kyuu and Megu are heading there with the police now!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.280
They should be almost there.

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:11.860
I see.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.110
Interesting.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:19.530
Will you tell me then, where the fourth god will descend?

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:25.750
The twelve boxes that you put the bombs in
all had the names of jewels written on them.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.670
Garnet, amethyst, aquamarine.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.670
That's the order of birthstones.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.760
And those jewels each have an associated characteristic.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:40.720
Characteristic?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:45.060
The same way that flowers do.

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:49.480
The January birthstone, garnet, represents friendship.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:54.360
February birthstone, amethyst, represents fidelity.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:59.200
The March birthstone, aquamarine, courage.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:02.540
Wait. The places bombed up until now have been,

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.080
the "Friendship Memorial,

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.370
the "Fidelity Bank".

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:17.800
In this town there are, by chance, buildings whose names
correspond to the characteristics of the twelve birthstones.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:23.890
That is why you chose this place as your bombing
target, and call it the holy ground of the gods.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:28.940
Then the characteristic for the
next birthstone, diamond, is

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:32.270
“purity".

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:38.570
In other words, the building whose name
corresponds to that, Seijo Dept. Store!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.200
Am I wrong?

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.280
I see...

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.830
Don't say “I see.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.200
Just admit it already!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.210
Katagiri-sensei, turn on the monitor.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:49.330
Got it.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:54.880
We're in front of the Seijo Dept. store,
where there has been a bomb scare!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.260
As you can see, the front of the store is in a panic!

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.180
30 minutes until the explosion.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:08.440
Can DDS and the police find the
bomb before time runs out?

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.230
What can you do in just 30 minutes?

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.440
Foolish humans.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.450
The exit is that way!

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:23.200
Hurry everybody!

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:30.210
Where could there be a bomb in such a big store?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.580
That's what we have to find.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:32.920
No matter what!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.090
There are now only 15  minutes left.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:42.590
The police bomb squad and DDS
are searching for the bomb,

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.720
but we have yet to receive word that it's been found.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:47.520
How pathetic, really.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.060
Humanity is helpless in the face of my gods.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.060
Panic more!

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.730
Scamper about like insects more!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.690
Foolish humans!

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:02.360
Touyama-kun!

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.280
Please tell me!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:12.870
Think about how many people have been thrown
into a panic because of your bomb!

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:16.800
you've got warm blood running through your veins right?

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.760
If you've any humanity left, think about it!

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.260
Please!

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:22.590
Touyama.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:32.060
if you can get the diamond out of that ore and cut it into a round brilliant in under 30
seconds I will tell you.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.270
Why you... that's impossible!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:36.480
Of course.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.980
Only the gods could do that.

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:45.570
And the fourth god as well. We
humans are powerless against it.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:53.000
Captain, we've evacuated all customers and staff.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:57.590
Damn. Where is it?

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:58.960
It's no good, Kyuu!

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.380
It's not on this floor.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:01.760
DDS students!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:02.840
Captain!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.720
Unfortunately, time's up.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.890
Three minutes until time's up!

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.640
But the bomb remains to be found!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.230
The police are beginning to withdraw as well!

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:19.940
Dan-sensei!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.030
Kyuu says he's going to find the bomb
no matter what; he's still inside!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.070
What?

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.370
Katagiri-kun, can you can get a hold of Kyuu?

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:28.620
I'll try.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:29.830
Dammit.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:30.700
KYUU!

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:36.170
There's a report that a DDS detective is
still inside the school, will he be OK?

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:41.960
We've just been ordered to evacuate as well!

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:46.010
Sensei, I managed to get a hold of him over police radio.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.890
I'll put it on speaker.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.810
This is Kyuu!

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.600
Kyuu, get out of there now!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.810
I can't! We haven't found the bomb yet!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.900
There's only one minute left.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:02.900
Kyuu!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.410
This is my order as DDS principal!

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:09.450
If the detective gives up the crime will never be solved!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:12.660
I'll never give up!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:17.120
Kyuu!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.920
What a beautiful, beautiful sparkle!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.550
FOURTH GOD HAS DESCENDED TO EARTH!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.510
Ryuu!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.390
Kyuu's dead, he's dead!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:39.190
Why why why!

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:40.900
Touyama.

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:44.990
Dammit.

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:49.530
You win.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:51.490
Jewelry Summoner!

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:56.200
We may have been foolish to challenge your gods.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.380
It's too late for that now.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:05.550
But humanity is foolish; it only
grows by repeating its mistakes.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:08.130
Don't worry about it.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.090
Tell us one last thing.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:12.600
What?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.560
Where did you put the bomb?

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:22.610
The patio on the 7th floor, below the bench!

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:26.610
Kyuu, did you

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:27.400
Roger!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.990
I heard it just fine!

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:32.410
The bench on the 7th floor patio.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.330
What?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.170
That's it!

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.510
We've got the bomb!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:55.720
Good job.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.180
Whats going on?

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.940
This is the real Seijo Department Store.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:04.940
Impossible.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.900
A time difference trick.

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:07.860
A time difference?

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:12.360
We managed to identify the bomb's
location as Seijyo Department Store.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:17.370
But if we had to search through that
whole, huge store we'd never find it.

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:24.380
But you didn't seem like you'd talk, so
we decided to put on a little show.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.750
Then that explosion just now was...

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:30.800
A computer graphic I made.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:35.890
I am called the "God of Video Games”.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.470
And she was the reporter.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.980
Reporting live from the scene!

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.060
Very sorry; there was a mistake in our last report,

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:51.740
this is actually DDS's simulation classroom,
and there's still 5 minutes until 12.

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:55.280
Reporter Yukihira Sakurato, signing off.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:56.530
Well?

00:21:56.560 --> 00:22:00.580
The combination of her acting and
my CG was perfect, wasn't it?

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.330
You tricked me!

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:07.380
Who was it that said that lies were humanity's pleasure?

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:12.170
Impossible. My gods are perfect!

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.480
Have my gods... abandoned me?

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:25.270
Wasn't your "god" yourself?

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:27.650
Yoshinari Taiki.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:30.610
I've heard your name.

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:33.990
As a famous Jewelry Summoner.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:37.200
But you drowned in your own powers,

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:39.410
and began to exchange the words
of god with your own words.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:44.790
And eventually you, yourself became a false
god, as you tried to control everything.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:48.540
Is that not blasphemy against the gods?

00:22:56.620 --> 00:22:59.390
You guys really overdid it.

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:02.770
Well, as long as it worked out.

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:06.850
I'm sorry to have deceived you.

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:10.270
No, we noticed from the very start.

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:14.190
The time on the monitor was different
from the time on the clock.

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:19.910
But if he had checked the time it would've been all over.

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.160
He was so obsessed himself and his own doings
that he never bothered to check the time.

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:26.620
You knew that would happen, didn't you,

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:28.290
Well, yeah.

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:31.500
But what did you think of my great acting?

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:33.960
If Kyuu had tried it he would've
picked up on it immediately!

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:35.550
I can hear you,

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:39.300
But your acting was more effort than skill, Kinta!

00:23:39.740 --> 00:23:40.640
He's right.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.770
Somehow it's collapsing

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:54.140
Embracing such a feeling.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.030
Flowing.

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:58.910
I'd be worried tomorrow.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.120
If the same thing happened.

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:02.120
Go wrong.

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:06.460
He looks up at the sky, pondering

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:09.020
You're very far away.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:13.180
Show your heart if you have the courage

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:16.310
passing the border line.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:19.760
In order to get past, I walk against the wind

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:23.400
and I can finish a battle.

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:26.940
When I feel like an abandoned child

00:24:26.970 --> 00:24:30.360
then I'll stand in line with you.

00:24:30.390 --> 00:24:33.930
Facing the wind, I forget,

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:37.540
somehow this is the only important thing.

00:24:37.550 --> 00:24:40.290
We protect, because there Is no return.

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:41.890
It's becoming dearly.

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:45.840
Today I embrace, right now I conquer.

00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:56.260
Next Episode

00:24:47.710 --> 00:24:50.690
A threatening letter from a genius
violinist who committed suicide.

00:24:51.340 --> 00:24:53.900
The Q-class is dispatched to solve the mystery.

00:24:56.900 --> 00:24:58.970
The murders over the famous violin "Testiti Dragon"
 that occurred before their very eyes.

00:24:59.810 --> 00:25:03.670
The terrifying demon's melody resounds
 Throughout a house of illusions!

00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:06.420
There's one answer!

00:25:10.070 --> 00:25:12.720
But your acting was more effort than skill, Kinta!

00:25:14.610 --> 00:25:19.490
Kyuu... once you've said that... it's all over.
